                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 701.2511/63.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chilean Chargé to the
                            Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Chilean Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1910-12-18"><hi rendition="#italic">December 18,
                        1910</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: It is my extremely sad duty to notify your
                    excellency of the death this morning of the head of this legation, his
                    excellency Mr. Anibal Cruz, caused by a sudden attack of heart failure.</p>
                <p>In communicating this sad news to your excellency, I have, etc.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">A. Yoacham.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
